		<section class="vox__sec6">
			<div class="wrap">
				<h2 id='roi'  id="boomdevs_29" >ROI</h2>
				<h3 id='why-stitched-voice-stacks-get-expensive-fast'  id="boomdevs_30" >Why stitched voice stacks get expensive fast</h3>
				<p>A voice bot built from four different vendors&#8217; APIs isn&#8217;t just technically fragile — it&#8217;s operationally
					expensive. Every vendor is a separate contract, a separate SLA, a separate renewal negotiation, a separate
					procurement cycle, a separate integration your team has to maintain. Vox replaces all of that.</p>
				<div class="vs6__table">
					<div class="vs6t__column">
						<div class="vs6tc__head">
							<div class="bg"></div>
							<span>What enterprise <br />buyers actually ask</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 91%;"></div><span>How many vendors am I managing?</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 82%;"></div><span>Typical end-to-end response latency</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 91%;"></div><span>Languages supported</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 100%;"></div><span>Can I clone a specific brand voice?</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 88%;"></div><span>Channels supported</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 82%;"></div><span>CX + EX use cases</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 100%;"></div><span>Does the voice layer know what the AI is thinking?</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 91%;"></div><span>Cost structure at 100M+ annual minutes</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="vs6t__column">
						<div class="vs6tc__head">
							<div class="bg"></div>
							<span>Nexus Vox</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 59%;"></div><span>1</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 74%;"></div><span>&lt;400ms</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 59%;"></div><span>500+</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 94%;"></div><span>Yes, from 10 seconds of audio</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 100%;"></div><span>Telephony, web, and API from one configuration</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 80%;"></div><span>Both, natively</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 80%;"></div><span>Yes &#8211; shared runtime</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 91%;"></div><span>Single platform pricing</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="vs6t__column">
						<div class="vs6tc__head">
							<div class="bg"></div>
							<span>Traditional stitched <br />voice stacks</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 88%;"></div><span>4+ (STT, TTS, LLM, telephony)</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 80%;"></div><span>700–1,200ms</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 73%;"></div><span>20–40</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 97%;"></div><span>No, or severely limited</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 88%;"></div><span>Telephony-first</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 80%;"></div><span>CX only</span>
						</div>
						<div class="vs6tc__body">
							<div class="bg" style="width: 100%;"></div><span>No — separate systems</span>
